# Testing

When adding or changing features, add or update tests. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full conventions.

- **Runner:** Vitest v4 — `pnpm run test` from repo root
- **Files:** Co-locate as `src/**/*.test.ts` (excluded from `tsc` build)
- **Environments:** Node (`core`, `msw-cli`, `msw-mcp`); jsdom (`@msw-mcp/client`)
- **Patterns:** Unit tests with mocks; integration tests only for real WS/HTTP round-trips in `core`
- **CLI:** Test pure logic in `msw-cli/src/helpers.ts`, not `index.ts`
- **MCP tools:** Inject a fake `wsServer.sendMessage` — see existing tests in `packages/msw-mcp/src/tools/`

Before finishing, run `pnpm run test` (and `pnpm run build` if types changed).
